A. Commit message:
btrfs: backport unification of writer locks for subpage locking

B. Change summary:
This patch backports the changes from a newer version to unify the use of writer locks for subpage locking in btrfs. It converts relevant functions to use `btrfs_folio_set_writer_lock` and `btrfs_folio_end_writer_lock`, removes unnecessary reader lock handling, and adds new helper functions like `btrfs_subpage_start_writer` and `btrfs_subpage_find_writer_locked`.

C. Compatibility Risk:
Medium: Code diff will be applied and a pull request will be sent to the developer to merge, but there are no indirect changes expected to be done in other parts of the system.

